<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Adaptive-icon foreground: the brand symbol only (M-shaped rising chart with an upward arrow).
    Traced from the original logo artwork; path coordinates are in the artwork's 1254px space and the group
    scales them into the 108dp canvas. The symbol spans ~48dp around the center, inside the 66dp safe zone,
    so circle, squircle and rounded-square launcher masks never clip it. No background, shadow or container:
    the launcher supplies the shape and the background layer supplies the color.
-->
